    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #330\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nNo uncommitted changes remained. Pushed commit `567672a` to the existing branch `bb/relay-231-mcp-integration-03-07-add-an-mcp-clien-thr_7zw42dhena`.\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the latest code-review fix commit to `bb/relay-231-mcp-integration-03-07-add-an-mcp-clien-thr_7zw42dhena`, which resolves the remaining medium-severity finding from PR #330's review:\n\n- Fixed an unhandled-promise-rejection risk in `withTimeout` (`mcpConnectionFactory.ts`) where a timed-out `connect()` promise's later rejection (after `safeCloseTransport` closes the transport) had no handler and could crash the process.\n- Also addressed the low-priority suggestion: the SSE/HTTP contract test servers now respond with an error instead of hanging the client when a request handler throws.\n\nFull test suite (unit: 83, integration: 539, e2e: 5), the dependency-boundary check, and the full monorepo build all pass.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
