    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #330\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to branch `bb/relay-231-mcp-integration-03-07-add-an-mcp-clien-thr_7zw42dhena`.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis push addresses the round-4 code review finding on PR #330 (CI run `101923073565`):\n\n**Medium test-coverage finding**: the `http` describe block in `backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/mcpConnectionFactory.test.ts` only had one test (credential-injection happy path), while `stdio` and `sse` each also covered connecting without a stored credential and cleanup after a failed connect.\n\n**Fix** (commit `9b7e284`): added two tests to the `http` block, mirroring the equivalent stdio/sse cases:\n- `\"connects with no credential when none is stored\"` — verifies `authProviderOptions(null)` correctly results in no auth header being sent.\n- `\"leaves no open socket after a failed connect\"` — stops the contract server before connecting and asserts `McpConnectionError` with reason `handshake_failed`, exercising `safeCloseTransport` for the Streamable HTTP transport.\n\nVerified in this turn:\n- `tsc --noEmit` — clean\n- Unit tests — 83/83 passed\n- Integration tests (includes the new HTTP tests) — 541/541 passed\n- E2E tests — 5/5 passed\n- Dependency-boundary check — no violations\n- Monorepo build — succeeded\n\nAll four rounds of review findings on this PR are now resolved.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
